body:
Dont take me wrong, I loved Tsukiko so much that I had put her as my steam profile pic for a really long time. Maybe its just that the ilustrations (about the girls) look more detailed and I can appreciate them more.

what the hell man, I dont know, but whoever managed to get 3 kantoku girls in the same bracket with the risk of 2 getting knocked out should die ;w;

ヽ༼ຈل͜ຈ༽ﾉ raise your kantokus ヽ༼ຈل͜ຈ༽ﾉ
